 "key_sub": "Le dénominateur partage, le numérateur multiplie.",
 "body_html": "<h2>Comment faire</h2><p><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> de 36, c’est 36 partagé en 4 : 36 ÷ 4 = 9.</p><p><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> de 36 : on prend 3 fois le quart : 9 × 3 = 27.</p><p>Pour une grandeur, on passe à une unité plus petite : <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> h = 60 min ÷ 4 × 3 = 45 min.</p><p>5 × <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span>, c’est <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> + <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> + <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> + <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> + <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>10</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> : on multiplie le numérateur.</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Exemple</span><p class='sn-ex-q'><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>5</span></span> de 40</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>40 ÷ 5 = 8</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>8 × 3 = 24</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Réponse : 24</p></div><h2>Erreurs fréquentes</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>Erreur fréquente</th><th>Ce qu'il faut faire</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Multiplier au lieu de diviser : <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> de 36 = 144</td><td>Prendre un quart, c’est partager en 4 : 9.</td></tr><tr><td>Oublier le numérateur : <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> de 36 = 9</td><td>9, c’est un quart. Trois quarts : 27.</td></tr><tr><td>5 × <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>2</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span> = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>10</span><span class='fd'>15</span></span></td><td>Les parts restent des tiers : <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>10</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
